FindUI Standard Licence v1

This licence is the one licence for every FindUI kit. There
are no per-kit licence variants.

1. Retrieval: agents and tools may retrieve and cite this kit through
   FindUI, and builders may use it as design reference.
2. Eval: this kit may be included in FindUI eval sets and benchmarks.
3. Implementation: you may implement designs based on this kit in
   your own product.
4. Training is never permitted. No one may use this kit, its
   components, or its flow data to train or fine-tune a model, at any
   price. No opt-in exists, and no separate agreement can grant it.
5. Attribution is a condition of this licence. Credit the creator at
   the attribution URL in ATTRIBUTION.md wherever the kit is used.
6. No redistribution of the kit itself as a standalone package or
   template, outside FindUI channels.

The creator may take the kit down through FindUI. Takedown stops new
distribution; uses already made under this licence stay licensed.
